From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler Baker <tyler.baker@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:01:07 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] dts: upstream: import the Eliza device trees from v7.3-dts

The Eliza CQS EVK device tree and the PMIC fragments it includes reached
dts/upstream with the v7.3-dts subtree merge (40988fb81ef1), which also
reworked eliza.dtsi. Take the Eliza files from that merge, including the
MTP device tree that has to follow the new eliza.dtsi, so the EVK can be
built with DEVICE_TREE=qcom/eliza-cqs-evk before the next full
dts/upstream sync.

Signed-off-by: Tyler Baker <tyler.baker@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://git.u-boot-project.org/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/40988fb81ef17c15c36aab94297f5a7a6bc79671]
---
